>> numbers := ['1,2,3'] phua: [','].
Tawm sau-ntawv: ['I got: '] + numbers tus-lej-suav + [' numbers.'],kab-tshiab.
{ :i Tawm sau-ntawv: ['number #'] + i + [':'] + (numbers qhov-chaw: i), kab-tshiab.} × 3.
>> beverages := ['Tea Or Coffee Or Milk Or Orange Juice Or Water'].
beverages := beverages phua: [' Or '].
Tawm sau-ntawv: ['We serve'], kab-tshiab.
{ :i Tawm sau-ntawv: ['->'] + (beverages qhov-chaw: i), kab-tshiab. } × (beverages tus-lej-suav).
Tawm sau-ntawv: (beverages muab-sib-txuas: [',']), kab-tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: (numbers muab-sib-txuas: ['||']).
